<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  1.27 %			C/S =  1.91 %</p>
<p>	    O/N =  1.27 % (Discount)	 O/N =  1.27 %</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.27 %			T/N =  1.27 %</p>
<p>		   Feb  26, 1997			Feb 25, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.79 %     1 month forward =  6.10 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.63 %     2 month forward =  7.63 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.35 %     3 month forward =  7.46 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.21 %     4 month forward =  7.29 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.46 %     5 month forward =  7.60 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.42 %     6 month forward =  7.47 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
